{
  "lf_start": {
    "id": "lf_start",
    "part": 1,
    "bg": "ldct_bg_restaurant",
    "sprite": null,
    "text": "2025年冬，医院旁的小饭馆。陆舟赴约时，身后还跟着他父亲。\n你刚站起来叫了声“陆叔”，陆舟已经替父亲拉开椅子，把烟灰缸挪远了。",
    "next": "lf_welcome"
  },
  "lf_welcome": {
    "id": "lf_welcome",
    "part": 1,
    "bg": "ldct_bg_restaurant",
    "sprite": "@luzhou",
    "speaker": "luzhou",
    "text": "你先坐。我爸非说今天只是来吃饭的。",
    "next": "lf_arrive_0"
  },
  "lf_arrive_0": {
    "id": "lf_arrive_0",
    "bg": "ldct_bg_restaurant",
    "sprite": "ldct_char_father_v1",
    "speaker": "陆叔",
    "text": "说好吃饭的。你别一坐下，又说那个CT。",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_arrive_1"
  },
  "lf_arrive_1": {
    "id": "lf_arrive_1",
    "bg": "ldct_bg_restaurant",
    "sprite": "@luzhou",
    "speaker": "luzhou",
    "text": "爸，医生建议的检查，你拖两个星期了。烟抽了三十多年，就这时候特别怕辐射。",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_arrive_2"
  },
  "lf_arrive_2": {
    "id": "lf_arrive_2",
    "bg": "ldct_bg_restaurant",
    "sprite": "ldct_char_father_v1",
    "speaker": "陆叔",
    "text": "我好好的，进去照一遍，万一照出毛病呢？",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_arrive_3"
  },
  "lf_arrive_3": {
    "id": "lf_arrive_3",
    "bg": "ldct_bg_restaurant",
    "sprite": "ldct_char_father_v1",
    "speaker": "me",
    "text": "叔叔，汤先盛上。你们这架，菜还没上就吵完了。",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_persuade"
  },
  "lf_persuade": {
    "id": "lf_persuade",
    "part": 1,
    "bg": "ldct_bg_restaurant",
    "sprite": "ldct_char_father_v1",
    "speaker": "陆叔",
    "text": "烟我能少抽。这个CT，能不做就不做吧。",
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "listen",
        "text": "先听听他到底怕什么",
        "next": "lf_listen_0",
        "decision": {
          "key": "father_tone",
          "value": "listen"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "joke",
        "text": "“咱先吃饭，别让这顿饭也背上辐射的锅。”",
        "next": "lf_joke_0",
        "decision": {
          "key": "father_tone",
          "value": "joke"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "lf_listen_0": {
    "id": "lf_listen_0",
    "bg": "ldct_bg_restaurant",
    "sprite": "ldct_char_father_v1",
    "speaker": "陆叔",
    "text": "隔壁老李说，片子照多了也能得病。我这不是两头堵吗。",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_listen_1"
  },
  "lf_listen_1": {
    "id": "lf_listen_1",
    "bg": "ldct_bg_restaurant",
    "sprite": "ldct_char_father_v1",
    "speaker": "me",
    "text": "这顾虑可以问。让医生把两头都讲清楚，别让陆舟光跟您比谁嗓门大。",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_consult_0"
  },
  "lf_joke_0": {
    "id": "lf_joke_0",
    "bg": "ldct_bg_restaurant",
    "sprite": "ldct_char_father_v1",
    "speaker": "陆叔",
    "text": "对，菜快凉了。他回来两天，就会盯着我。",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_joke_1"
  },
  "lf_joke_1": {
    "id": "lf_joke_1",
    "bg": "ldct_bg_restaurant",
    "sprite": "ldct_char_father_v1",
    "speaker": "me",
    "text": "您担心的先记下，回头让医生解释。陆舟，筷子拿起来，别拿挂号单当菜单。",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_consult_0"
  },
  "lf_consult_0": {
    "id": "lf_consult_0",
    "bg": "bg_waiting",
    "sprite": "ldct_char_father_v1",
    "text": "后来，陆舟陪父亲按预约回到门诊。医师重新核对年龄、吸烟和既往检查情况，解释为什么建议低剂量胸部CT，也回答了陆叔对辐射的担忧。",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_consult_1"
  },
  "lf_consult_1": {
    "id": "lf_consult_1",
    "bg": "bg_waiting",
    "sprite": "ldct_char_father_v1",
    "speaker": "陆叔",
    "text": "你们不是为了照得亮，就一个劲往上加？",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_consult_2"
  },
  "lf_consult_2": {
    "id": "lf_consult_2",
    "bg": "bg_waiting",
    "sprite": "@luzhou",
    "speaker": "luzhou",
    "text": "爸，方案由医生评估。我不替你调，咱把不明白的问完。",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_scan_0"
  },
  "lf_scan_0": {
    "id": "lf_scan_0",
    "bg": "bg_ctcontrol_day_ready",
    "sprite": "ldct_char_father_v1",
    "speaker": "陆叔",
    "text": "行。做吧。陆舟，你别一副比我还紧张的样子。",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_scan_1"
  },
  "lf_scan_1": {
    "id": "lf_scan_1",
    "bg": "bg_ctcontrol_day_ready",
    "sprite": null,
    "text": "陆叔完成了医师安排的检查。陆舟一直陪着，傍晚才来找你和老周。他把缴费单折了又展，边角已经起毛。",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_scan_2"
  },
  "lf_scan_2": {
    "id": "lf_scan_2",
    "bg": "bg_ctcontrol_day_ready",
    "sprite": "ch2_pixel_char_zhou",
    "speaker": "zhou",
    "text": "都坐，别着急。先别盯着我表情猜报告。",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_first_fbp"
  },
  "lf_first_fbp": {
    "id": "lf_first_fbp",
    "part": 1,
    "bg": "bg_ctcontrol_day_ready",
    "sprite": null,
    "chestPreview": "fbp",
    "speaker": "zhou",
    "text": "这处很淡，旁边又挨着血管。原来的FBP图不是整张都不能看，但这里，**不能随口说没事**。我要再核一下完整序列。",
    "next": "lf_license_0"
  },
  "lf_license_0": {
    "id": "lf_license_0",
    "bg": "bg_ctcontrol_day_ready",
    "sprite": null,
    "speaker": "me",
    "text": "不是还有迭代重建吗？我在设备菜单里见过。",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_license_1"
  },
  "lf_license_1": {
    "id": "lf_license_1",
    "bg": "bg_ctcontrol_day_ready",
    "sprite": null,
    "text": "你按设备联系簿拨给工程师。陆舟靠过来听，手指仍压着那张缴费单。",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_license_2"
  },
  "lf_license_2": {
    "id": "lf_license_2",
    "bg": "bg_ctcontrol_day_ready",
    "sprite": null,
    "speaker": "工程师（电话）",
    "text": "这台配的是基础重建。那个迭代包是收费选配，院里这套没开通，所以按钮是灰的。",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_license_3"
  },
  "lf_license_3": {
    "id": "lf_license_3",
    "bg": "bg_ctcontrol_day_ready",
    "sprite": "@luzhou",
    "speaker": "luzhou",
    "text": "我爸都拍完了，才发现还差这么一包。",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_license_choice"
  },
  "lf_license_choice": {
    "id": "lf_license_choice",
    "part": 1,
    "bg": "bg_ctcontrol_day_ready",
    "sprite": "ch2_pixel_char_zhou",
    "text": "你盯着那个灰掉的选项。老周已经拿起电话，安排后续复核。",
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "existing",
        "text": "“同一次的数据，能不能再算一版？”",
        "next": "lf_existing_0",
        "decision": {
          "key": "license_reaction",
          "value": "existing"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "complain",
        "text": "“这种时候才告诉我还有付费包……”",
        "next": "lf_complain_0",
        "decision": {
          "key": "license_reaction",
          "value": "complain"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "lf_existing_0": {
    "id": "lf_existing_0",
    "bg": "bg_ctcontrol_day_ready",
    "sprite": "ch2_pixel_char_zhou",
    "speaker": "zhou",
    "text": "能不能导出，要先查设备接口。临床这边该复核、该转诊，不等你们算完。",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_export_0"
  },
  "lf_complain_0": {
    "id": "lf_complain_0",
    "bg": "bg_ctcontrol_day_ready",
    "sprite": "ch2_pixel_char_zhou",
    "speaker": "zhou",
    "text": "气我懂。不过先把病人的事接住。设备采购这笔账，另找时间算。",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_export_0"
  },
  "lf_export_0": {
    "id": "lf_export_0",
    "bg": "bg_breakroom",
    "sprite": "@luzhou",
    "text": "科室已有重建评估项目，陆舟也在获准参与范围内。陆叔另行同意去标识研究使用后，工程师把限定范围的副本导到院内工作站，临床流程继续走。",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_export_1"
  },
  "lf_export_1": {
    "id": "lf_export_1",
    "bg": "bg_breakroom",
    "sprite": "@luzhou",
    "speaker": "me",
    "text": "拿到了。是**原始投影和校准信息**，不是几张PACS截图。今晚就在这台工作站试。",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_export_2"
  },
  "lf_export_2": {
    "id": "lf_export_2",
    "bg": "bg_breakroom",
    "sprite": "@luzhou",
    "speaker": "luzhou",
    "text": "好。我先给我爸回个电话，让他别在外头等咱们熬。",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_review_intro_0",
    "complete": "father_projection_authorized"
  },
  "lf_review_intro_0": {
    "id": "lf_review_intro_0",
    "bg": "bg_breakroom",
    "sprite": "@luzhou",
    "speaker": "me",
    "text": "正弦图怎么又长这样了。刚才饭馆的桌布，都比它容易看懂。",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_review_intro_1"
  },
  "lf_review_intro_1": {
    "id": "lf_review_intro_1",
    "bg": "bg_breakroom",
    "sprite": "@luzhou",
    "speaker": "luzhou",
    "text": "本科讲这节，你就睡我旁边。先拿模体找手感。",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_review_intro_2"
  },
  "lf_review_intro_2": {
    "id": "lf_review_intro_2",
    "bg": "bg_breakroom",
    "sprite": "@luzhou",
    "speaker": "me",
    "text": "你怎么知道我睡着了？",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_review_intro_3"
  },
  "lf_review_intro_3": {
    "id": "lf_review_intro_3",
    "bg": "bg_breakroom",
    "sprite": "@luzhou",
    "speaker": "luzhou",
    "text": "因为你打呼噜，把我也吵醒了。点一下那个小结构，别又睡。",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_lab_1"
  },
