    "id": "lf_after_filter_1",
    "bg": "bg_breakroom",
    "sprite": "@luzhou",
    "speaker": "luzhou",
    "text": "今晚先到这。我刚给我爸回“正在滤波”，他以为咱还没吃饭。",
    "part": 1,
    "next": "lf_after_filter_2"
  },
  "lf_after_filter_2": {
    "id": "lf_after_filter_2",
    "bg": "bg_breakroom",
    "sprite": "@luzhou",
    "speaker": "me",
    "text": "也不算猜错。饭凉了两次，明晚先吃再算。",
